ellipsoid 9 21 9 5 3.6 5 p
ellipsoid 9 26.5 9 3.6 3.2 3.6 p
ellipsoid 9 31 9 2 3.2 2 p
paint ellipsoid 7.5 12 7.5 6 1.5 6 h
paint ellipsoid 7.5 18 7.5 5 1.5 5 h
paint ellipsoid 7.5 23.6 7.5 3.8 1.3 3.8 h
